      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your fear is valid, but the idea that you are a burden is a lie your mind is telling you to protect itself from the pain of change. Leaving now would be a way to stop the suffering, but it would also mean leaving the person you are right now behind forever. You deserve to be heard and understood, not to be a ghost in someone else's world.",
      "source": "target",
