      "content": "It is a terrible burden to carry when you feel like you are losing yourself, but the idea that you are a burden to others is a cruel lie your mind tells you to escape the pain. Leaving now would be an act of mercy, yet it would also mean abandoning the very person you are fighting to save. There is no dignity in disappearing; there is only the quiet, final end of a story that deserves to be finished.",
